msgstr "Berikut ialah garis besar visual struktur data `PrimitiveResult`:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Put simply, a single job returns a "
"[`PrimitiveResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult)"
" object and contains a list of one or more "
"[`SamplerPubResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.SamplerPubResult)"
" objects. These `SamplerPubResult` objects then store the measurement data "
"for each PUB that was submitted to the job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ringkasnya, satu kerja mengembalikan objek "
"[`PrimitiveResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult)"
" dan mengandungi senarai satu atau lebih objek "
"[`SamplerPubResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.SamplerPubResult)."
" Objek `SamplerPubResult` ini kemudian menyimpan data pengukuran untuk "
"setiap PUB yang diserahkan kepada kerja.\n"

